title: The purpose of our media is to elect more Catholics.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; catholics_z += 2*(1-dissent)

Our campaign media is mostly reaching the Catholics who already vote for us, but it must be doing *something*, or at least that is what we hope.

